---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../site.config';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Terms & Conditions | SM Global Accounting Services"
  description="The terms that apply when you use the SM Global Accounting Services website. Please read them before sending us an enquiry."
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow">Terms &amp; Conditions</p>
      <h1>Terms &amp; Conditions</h1>
      <p class="lead">Last updated: 7 October 2026</p>

      <div class="grid" style="max-width: 760px; margin-top: var(--space-3); margin-inline: auto;">
        <div>
          <h2>1. Who we are</h2>
          <p>
            This website is operated by {SITE.name}, a business registered in India, with its
            registered address in Mumbai, India. Email:
            <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>. By using this site you agree to these
            terms. If you do not agree, please do not use the site. These terms cover use of this
            website only. They are not a client engagement contract.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2>2. This site is informational</h2>
          <p>
            Content on this site describes our services in general terms. It is not accounting, tax or
            legal advice, and nothing on it forms a contract between us and you. A service engagement
            only begins once we have agreed scope, pricing and terms directly with your practice in a
            separate engagement letter. Actual client work is governed by that letter, not by this page.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2>3. Accuracy</h2>
          <p>
            We try to keep this site accurate and up to date, but we do not guarantee that every detail
            is current or error-free, and we may change the content at any time without notice. Figures
            and descriptions of our work are given in good faith and may change as our business does.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2>4. Using the site</h2>
          <p>
            You may use this site for lawful purposes only. You must not try to gain unauthorised
            access to it, interfere with its operation, introduce malicious code, or use it to send us
            anything unlawful or misleading. We may restrict access to the site at any time.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2>5. Intellectual property and trademarks</h2>
          <p>
            The content, design, images and branding on this site, including the SM Global logo,
            belong to {SITE.name} unless otherwise stated. You may view and print pages for your own
            reference, but you may not copy, republish or reuse content from this site commercially
            without our written permission.
          </p>
          <p>
            Product and company names mentioned on this site (for example Xero, QuickBooks, IRIS, CCH
            and TaxCalc) are trademarks of their owners. We use them only to describe the software we
            work in. No partnership with, or endorsement by, those companies is implied.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2>6. Third-party links</h2>
          <p>
            This site may link to third-party websites. We do not control those sites and are not
            responsible for their content or their privacy practices.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2>7. Liability</h2>
          <p>
            This site is provided &ldquo;as is&rdquo;. To the extent permitted by law, we are not liable
            for any loss or damage arising from your use of, or reliance on, this website, including
            indirect or consequential loss. Nothing in these terms limits or excludes liability for
            death or personal injury caused by negligence, for fraud or fraudulent misrepresentation,
            or for anything else that cannot legally be limited or excluded.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2>8. Governing law</h2>
          <p>
            These terms are governed by the laws of India, and the courts of Mumbai have exclusive
            jurisdiction over any dispute arising from them or from your use of this site. This does
            not affect any mandatory rights you have under the law of the country where you live.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2>9. Changes to these terms</h2>
          <p>We may update these terms from time to time. The &ldquo;last updated&rdquo; date at the top shows the current version. Continued use of the site means you accept the updated terms.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2>10. Contact</h2>
          <p>
            Questions about these terms can be sent to <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>.
            See also our <a href="/privacy-policy">Privacy Policy</a>.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
